### Request to get all contacts
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/contacts HTTP/1.1

### Get contact with id 10
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/contacts/10 HTTP/1.1

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "first": "Bob",
    "last": "Carolgees",
    "phone": "234-567-8901",
    "email": "bob.carolgees@example.com"
}

### Edit a contact
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/v1/contacts/16 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "first": "Bob",
    "last": "Carolgees",
    "phone": "345-678-9012",
    "email": "bob.carolgees@example.com"
}

### Delete a contact
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/contacts/16 HTTP/1.1
